      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "BLS reported on September 4, 2026 that August payrolls increased by 162,000 while unemployment stayed at 4.1%. Revised gains were 31,000 for June and 21,000 for July, adding 55,000 jobs to earlier totals. July initially showed a 23,000 decline.",
